# ARK Ecosystem Identity

ARK is multiple products with **one recognizable mark** in the browser tab.

## Products (names stay distinct)

| Product | Typical host |
|---------|----------------|
| ARK SMS | `app.lugsnplugs.com`, `portal.lugsnplugs.com` |
| ARKademy | `learn.lugsnplugs.com` (BookStack) |
| ARK-WEB | `lugsnplugs.com` (`arkweb` repo) — shop branding exception |
| Arkify | `platform.autorepairkeeper.com` (Coolify) |

## Ecosystem standard (default)

- **Same ARK favicon** on all products unless a strong, documented exception exists.
- **Same logo family** and **primary blue** (`#0099cc` cerulean) where practical.
- Product differentiation is **name and copy**, not a different tab icon.

## Favicon source of truth

```
public/assets/ARK_SMS_FINAL_DROP_IN_PACK/favicon/
```

ARK SMS runtime: `App\Support\Branding\Branding` + `resources/views/partials/branding/_favicons.blade.php`

Do not introduce product-specific favicons in ARK SMS without updating this doctrine and `docs/branding/ecosystem-identity.md`.

## Implementation by surface

| Surface | Approach |
|---------|----------|
| **ARK SMS** | `Branding::favicon()` — already wired on all layouts |
| **ARKademy** | Theme `public/favicon/` + `infra/coolify/bookstack/apply-branding.sh` (`app-custom-head`) — no BookStack vendor edits |
| **ARK-WEB** | `lugsnplugs.com` — **shop branding exception** (LugsNPlugs favicon/OG, not ARK mark) |
| **Arkify** | `platform.autorepairkeeper.com` (Coolify) — `infra/branding/apply-arkify-branding.sh` |

Sync script: `infra/branding/sync-ecosystem-favicons.sh`

## When changing branding

1. Update the **pack** first (single source of truth).
2. Run sync for BookStack theme; re-run `apply-branding.sh` on production after BookStack upgrades.
3. Update `docs/branding/inventory.md` and `docs/branding/ecosystem-identity.md` if assets or wiring change.
4. Do not patch Coolify or BookStack vendor code for favicons when settings, themes, or `app-custom-head` suffice.

## Anti-patterns

- BookStack / Coolify default icons left on production hosts
- Per-product favicon files scattered outside the pack
- Duplicating favicon logic in Blade instead of `Branding` (ARK SMS)
- Cosmetic-only one-off icons that break tab recognition across ARK SMS ↔ ARKademy ↔ Arkify

## Future note

Per-product **accent color** on the same mark (blue / teal / purple) is optional later. **Consistency beats cleverness** until then.
